WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.740 line:8%
So we're going to talk about
things that are not accessible.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.300 line:8%
It's not necessarily
just a lack of trying.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.040
A lot of the times,
people just don't know.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.200
So, no disrespect, but, like,
this kind of thing is frustrating.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.860
Like, this level of contrast
is fantastic.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.700
This black on white background,
it's easy to see.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.840
But usually then I try
and get it into the frame,

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.540
and all of a sudden it goes yellow.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.319
But now the contrast ratio
is bad enough

00:00:24.359 --> 00:00:27.180
that I can't hardly tell
what I'm looking at.

00:00:27.519 --> 00:00:30.399
That's a big, big sticking point.

00:00:30.439 --> 00:00:35.220
None of this is clickable at the moment,
'cause this popup has occurred.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:39.199
So it can be difficult.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:41.400
It's a popup showing up on a web page,

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:46.440
and you can't get out of it,
or you can't find it.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.220
This is pretty confusing.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:54.039
The popup is only findable
based on this contrast here,

00:00:54.079 --> 00:00:55.080
between this and this.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:58.259
But otherwise it's difficult
to see it's even there.

00:00:58.719 --> 00:01:00.760
So sometimes I'll be clicking
around on a site

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.779
and I'm like, why is nothing working?

00:01:03.079 --> 00:01:04.680
And then I'm looking around the page,

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.000
I'm trying to figure out what's what,

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.680
and I finally find that,
oh, there's a popup.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.200
I need to close that.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:12.540
And then things start functioning again.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.700
[Music]
